      "title": "Cyber-attack on French supermarket freezers has geopolitical context",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/nov/09/cyber-attack-french-supermarket-freezers-iran-europe",
      "description": "<p>‘Not particularly complex’ defrosting hack has been attributed to Iran, with presumption it is linked to others across Europe</p><p>Iranian hackers like to send a message.</p><p>In 2023 a state-backed group interrupted TV streaming services in the United Arab Emirates to broadcast a deepfake report on the war in Gaza. In the same year, hackers affiliated with Iran displayed the slogan “down with Israel” on the screens of <a href=\"https://www.sophos.com/en-us/blog/iranian-cyber-av3ngers-compromise-unitronics-systems\">water-control equipment</a> made by an Israeli firm.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/nov/09/cyber-attack-french-supermarket-freezers-iran-europe\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-09T19:40:45"
    },
    {
      "title": "Iran was behind cyber-attack on French supermarket freezers, Paris says",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/09/france-blames-irans-revolutionary-guards-for-cyber-attacks-on-supermarket-fridges",
      "description": "<p>French foreign minister vows European sanctions against Tehran over ‘unprecedented’ hacks last month</p><p>France has said Iran was responsible for a massive cyber-attack on supermarket freezers and chiller cabinets that was described by its foreign minister as being an act of “unprecedented scale and unprecedented aggression”.</p><p>Jean-Noël Barrot said “Europe-wide sanctions” would be imposed against those responsible, adding that the attacks – which took control of digital thermostats to push temperatures up to above 50C – constituted “a major violation of the nation’s interests”.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/09/france-blames-irans-revolutionary-guards-for-cyber-attacks-on-supermarket-fridges\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-09T17:54:40"
    },
